#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:4 bd595940a8a14672ade111acab25a49c
msgid "上传和管理个人文件"
msgstr "Upload and Manage Personal Files"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:7 be14f9c8761a4712bbc8a0ed45d4f69d
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:9 aaa19c3b4b6f4449b86a44996be9679d
msgid "帮助用户完成文件上传和个人目录管理的基础操作。"
msgstr ""
"Help users complete basic file upload and personal directory management "
"operations."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:12 3e58934b2fe94184bc78f7d66c17c441
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to Access"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:14 90e3576def164c36a31ea749531df0e5
msgid "点击左侧菜单 ``文件管理``，进入个人文件页面。"
msgstr ""
"Click ``File Management`` in the left menu to open the personal files page."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:17 d390d540edde4ca4ae768070e60e645f
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page Overview"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:19 5329ab1fcbc944249ea424f20aa51548
msgid ""
"页面顶部显示当前路径 ``scorr/``；下方是工具栏，包含 ``返回上一级`` ``新建文件夹`` ``上传文件`` 按钮和 ``搜索文件`` "
"输入框。"
msgstr ""
"The current path ``scorr/`` is shown at the top. Below is a toolbar with "
"``Go Up``, ``New Folder``, and ``Upload File`` buttons, plus a ``Search "
"Files`` input box."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:22 8ce2931b19324a8c9766ba43dc56e771
msgid ""
"主体是文件列表表格，列包含 ``文件名``、``文件大小``、``上次修改时间``、 ``操作``。每个文件行最右侧 ``操作`` 列有一个红色 "
"``×`` 按钮用于删除。"
msgstr ""
"The main area is a file list table with columns ``File Name``, ``File "
"Size``, ``Last Modified``, and ``Actions``. Each row has a red ``x`` button "
"in the ``Actions`` column for deletion."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:29 70ca37a8bd884216bd8ff40872088f2a
msgid "文件管理页面"
msgstr "File management page"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:29 ef3d9065b4cc4563b131368d18a138d5
msgid "文件管理页面，显示当前用户个人目录的文件列表。"
msgstr ""
"File management page showing the file list in the current user's personal "
"directory."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:32 89facb5e06cd42ac81cdccca9fcf361b
msgid "上传文件流程"
msgstr "Upload File Workflow"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:34 1d5527a30137431e91f2c3c2fa7aaad2
msgid "在 ``文件管理`` 页面点击 ``上传文件`` 按钮。"
msgstr "On the ``File Management`` page, click ``Upload File``."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:35 1173f9129e81434caf9ad64c4fae4467
msgid "在弹出的对话框中选择本地文件，确认上传。"
msgstr "In the dialog, select a local file and confirm the upload."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:36 a13ef262f17d4b68912042d4f7fb1692
msgid "上传完成后，文件出现在列表中。"
msgstr "After the upload completes, the file appears in the list."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:42 b5a6372cd7154ed5afe9eb6755abb73b
msgid "文件上传对话框"
msgstr "File upload dialog"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:42 bf1665a4f74d4178b7b4db3cfa55754b
msgid "点击 ``上传文件`` 后弹出的上传对话框。"
msgstr "Upload dialog shown after clicking ``Upload File``."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:45 31ef2c8335564ed4a828a289309fef49
msgid "新建文件夹流程"
msgstr "Create Folder Workflow"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:47 89901aec745149e09d2cab2d5e58eb06
msgid "在 ``文件管理`` 页面点击 ``新建文件夹`` 按钮。"
msgstr "On the ``File Management`` page, click ``New Folder``."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:48 eac5883097284ac3b50b46a18673a754
msgid "在弹出的对话框中输入文件夹名称。"
msgstr "Enter the folder name in the dialog."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:49 d2ce296fb0d3406eb433ac8c6663a351
msgid "确认后，新文件夹出现在文件列表中。"
msgstr "After confirmation, the new folder appears in the file list."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:52 675db8fc856f476792ff019b9f6d2656
msgid "删除文件流程"
msgstr "Delete File Workflow"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:56 fbfcdb90a65e4bb9a49110247ff28b6c
msgid ""
"删除操作不可恢复，请在删除前确认该文件已不再需要。**不要删除个人 目录中已有的 "
"``.bashrc``、``.bash_profile``、``log.*.out`` 等系统 或作业日志文件**，避免影响应用与作业运行。"
msgstr ""
"Deletion cannot be undone. Confirm the file is no longer needed before "
"deleting. **Do not delete existing system or job log files in your personal "
"directory such as ``.bashrc``, ``.bash_profile``, or ``log.*.out``**, to "
"avoid affecting applications and jobs."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:60 9a0c86a9c54b4f10ae296aa358ed5b6e
msgid "在文件列表中找到需要删除的文件。"
msgstr "Find the file to delete in the file list."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:61 09ecd856d6b241e3a496b3215b4596c6
msgid "点击该行最右侧的红色 ``×`` 按钮。"
msgstr "Click the red ``x`` button at the far right of that row."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:62 f941fd66da6f46d28af977f2f23081bc
msgid "在确认对话框中点击 ``确定``，完成删除。"
msgstr "Click ``OK`` in the confirmation dialog to complete deletion."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:65 6ef14c7775c7486ea5aa17937bd5e8e4
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:67 6f3cd018c422475c998cd081a4aa117c
msgid ""
"**文件上传失败怎么办？** 检查网络连接是否正常，确认文件大小未超过平台限制；如反复失败，请 提交工单并附上文件大小、扩展名和失败提示截图。"
msgstr ""
"**What if file upload fails?** Check your network connection and confirm the"
" file size is within platform limits. If failures persist, submit a ticket "
"with the file size, extension, and a screenshot of the error."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:71 89e23cbc73fe4526a73a05133c759373
msgid "**找不到上传的文件怎么办？** 检查页面顶部的当前路径是否正确；使用工具栏的 ``搜索文件`` 输入关键 字检索。"
msgstr ""
"**What if I cannot find an uploaded file?** Verify the current path at the "
"top of the page; use ``Search Files`` in the toolbar to search by keyword."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:75 e4ca61213e0f44c6bb8cc5a223efa15e
msgid "**删除后是否可恢复？** 不可恢复，请删除前再次确认。"
msgstr ""
"**Can deleted files be recovered?** No. Confirm again before deleting."
